{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Stunt Paradise 2</strong> \u2014 the arcade world where speed and chaos rule the road! This is the place where adrenaline spikes, explosions roar at every corner, and your driving skills are always on the edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034580/extras/22a92d324e80757b3a3ea3669299c367.poster.avif?t=1772041980\" width=798 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034580/extras/22a92d324e80757b3a3ea3669299c367.webm?t=1772041980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034580/extras/22a92d324e80757b3a3ea3669299c367.mp4?t=1772041980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for brand-new <strong>levels packed with unpredictable traps</strong>: lasers, buzzsaws, mines, explosives, and many other deadly surprises that turn every run into a true challenge. Jump across gaps, flip through the air, soar over ramps, and smash through obstacles \u2014 all in the rhythm of <strong>pure arcade madness</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game now features a major <strong>visual upgrade</strong>: detailed environments, flashy effects, and modern shaders that make every jump, every explosion, and every crash more spectacular than ever. It\u2019s easy to pick up but hard to master \u2014 simple yet deep gameplay that challenges even the most skilled drivers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034580/extras/a3ef597eb87d3f920180e6bed93f9b8a.poster.avif?t=1772041980\" width=798 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034580/extras/a3ef597eb87d3f920180e6bed93f9b8a.webm?t=1772041980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034580/extras/a3ef597eb87d3f920180e6bed93f9b8a.mp4?t=1772041980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunt Paradise 2</strong> delivers a <strong>wide selection of cars</strong>, dynamic levels, and an endless rush of adrenaline. It\u2019s the ultimate game for those who dare to risk, laugh at their own failures, and enjoy non-stop action!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New traps and mechanics: lasers, buzzsaws, explosives, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved graphics with modern effects and detailed environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkpoint system for smoother progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extreme stunts and explosive arcade action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driving rock composed by a professional guitarist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of cars for every playstyle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Step on the gas and experience pure chaos on wheels in <strong>Stunt Paradise 2</strong>!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4034580?t=1772041980","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4034580?t=1772041980","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034580/2d48c1bac10a72be857fc7c5eb779740409b1d1a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772041980","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034580/2d48c1bac10a72be857fc7c5eb779740409b1d1a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772041980","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller s